nd colorful representation of how a superhuman intelligence would rapidly evolve to make sense of the world around it, starting with the most basic concepts and walking towards a horizon beyond human understanding. This experience aims to expand the limits of graphic design taking advantage of VR technology, exploring the use of typography, color and shapes inside infinite, open spaces and its implications in data visualization. Experience length: 4 minutes.", "short_description": "Singularity is a motion graphic experience that creates an abstract, geometric and colorful representation of how a superhuman intelligence would rapidly evolve to make sense of the world around it, starting with the most basic concepts and walking towards a horizon beyond human understanding. This experience aims to expand the limits of graphic design, exploring the use of typography, color and shapes inside infinite, open spaces and its implications in data visualization. Length: 4 minutes"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.relajaelcoco.com/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.relajaelcoco.com/", "publisher_name": "Relajaelcoco", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.relajaelcoco.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["MUSIC", "MUSIC_VIDEO", "NARRATIVE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "641551577061560"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1923811947876152_8205